ark of the pine tree was shiny and dark.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.16978539,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.169761409,"realTimeFactor":0.05566734098360656,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":111,"text":"Leaves turn brown and yellow in the fall.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.151379689,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.151356749,"realTimeFactor":0.05455123927927929,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":112,"text":"The pennant waved when the wind blew.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.137182555,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.137161865,"realTimeFactor":0.05657012577319589,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":113,"text":"Split the log with a quick, sharp blow.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.161602808,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.161574958,"realTimeFactor":0.059303782752293574,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":114,"text":"Burn peat after the logs give out.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.147253404,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.147219993,"realTimeFactor":0.057185787961165045,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":115,"text":"He ordered peach pie with ice cream.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.13998679,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.139964759,"realTimeFactor":0.055994716,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":116,"text":"Weave the carpet on the right hand side.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.1503179,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.15029816,"realTimeFactor":0.05894819607843138,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":117,"text":"Hemp is a weed found in parts of the tropics.","audioSeconds":3.1,"runSeconds":0.173517732,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.173491142,"realTimeFactor":0.05597346193548387,"finite":true,"samples":74400},{"index":118,"text":"A lame back kept his score low.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.136009615,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.135988075,"realTimeFactor":0.0560864391752577